        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      },
      "_hdr": 1,
      "_note": "builtin 先落地成键再进方法参数(kmid.df 同款)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(index::(index::(${r1_q},0),0),0),1000000000000),formatDate::(${atNow},HH:mm),)]"
      },
      "_hdr": 1,
      "_note": "时效锚(card-design-system §3)= 取数时刻,不是末根 1 小时蜡烛的开盘时刻(原写法 19:44 取数显示 19:00)。卡上价格取自进行中的那根蜡烛、随每次取数变,与 kday / kmid 同理;24 小时交易、取数恒在当天,只有 HH:mm 一档。末根蜡烛的时间戳(毫秒)只用来判「取到了」—— 取不到留空,不渲假时刻。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ok1",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${s1n},0),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "这一槽到底有没有取到数。⚠️ 判据用 OHLC 的**根数**而不是 `length::(${s1last})` —— `length::` 遇到**数字**直接返回 0(vparser runtime.ts:1422),拿它判价格会把每一槽都判成空。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mv1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok1},1),findNotEmpty::(${s1chgA},-1),-1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ok2",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${s2n},0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mv2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok2},1),findNotEmpty::(${s2chgA},-1),-1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ok3",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${s3n},0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mv3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok3},1),findNotEmpty::(${s3chgA},-1),-1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ok4",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${s4n},0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mv4",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok4},1),findNotEmpty::(${s4chgA},-1),-1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ok5",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${s5n},0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mv5",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok5},1),findNotEmpty::(${s5chgA},-1),-1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pmax",
        "value": "$[max::(${mv1},${mv2},${mv3},${mv4},${mv5})]"
      },
      "_note": "|24h 涨跌幅| 的峰值。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_ks",
        "value": [
          "$[if::(eq::(${mv1},${pmax}),0,999)]",
          "$[if::(eq::(${mv2},${pmax}),1,999)]",
          "$[if::(eq::(${mv3},${pmax}),2,999)]",
          "$[if::(eq::(${mv4},${pmax}),3,999)]",
          "$[if::(eq::(${mv5},${pmax}),4,999)]"
        ]
      },
      "_note": "命中峰值的下标(0 基,对齐下面几个数组),没命中填 999。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pick",
        "value": "$[min::(${_ks})]"
      },
      "_note": "并列时取最小下标 = 自选列表靠前那个,结果确定。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_nms",
        "value": [
          "${nm1}",
          "${nm2}",
          "${nm3}",
          "${nm4}",
          "${nm5}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_ups",
        "value": [
          "${s1up}",
          "${s2up}",
          "${s3up}",
          "${s4up}",
          "${s5up}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_abs",
        "value": [
          "${s1chgA}",
          "${s2chgA}",
          "${s3chgA}",
          "${s4chgA}",
          "${s5chgA}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ldNm",
        "value": "$[index::(${_nms},${pick})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ldUp",
        "value": "$[index::(${_ups},${pick})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ldA",
        "value": "$[index::(${_abs},${pick})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ldS",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ldUp},1),+,-)]"
      },
      "_note": "行里的涨跌方向是靠 ▲▼ 三角画的,结论行是一句话、塞不下三角,所以这里补一个符号。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "okN",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ok1}+${ok2}+${ok3}+${ok4}+${ok5})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "vd",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${okN},1),0,if::(ge::(${pmax},1),1,2))]"
      },
      "_note": "三态:0=不显示(一个都没取到)/ 1=有领涨领跌 / 2=全都平静。\n阈值 **±1%**:与 stock/watch 取同一个数,不是因为两个市场的波动一样大(加密显然更野),而是因为**这行字回答的问题一样** —— 「要不要现在点进去看」。门槛调高会让加密卡在大多数日子里都沉默,而它恰恰是波动最值得被通知的那一类;调低则天天都在喊。1% 是「日内值得抬头看一眼」的通行量级,两个包保持一致,用户在仪表盘上并排看到两张卡时读到的是同一套语言。"
    },
    {
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "nm1",
          "L1",
          "L1T",
          "s1chgA",
          "s1up",
          "s1flat",
          "s1pts",
          "s1lastY",
          "nm2",
          "L2",
          "L2T",
          "s2chgA",
          "s2up",
          "s2flat",
          "s2pts",
          "s2lastY",
          "nm3",
          "L3",
          "L3T",
          "s3chgA",
          "s3up",
          "s3flat",
          "s3pts",
          "s3lastY",
          "nm4",
          "L4",
          "L4T",
          "s4chgA",
          "s4up",
          "s4flat",
          "s4pts",
          "s4lastY",
          "nm5",
          "L5",
          "L5T",
          "s5chgA",
          "s5up",
          "s5flat",
          "s5pts",
          "s5lastY",
          "at",
          "vd",
          "okN",
          "ldNm",
          "ldUp",
          "ldS",
          "ldA"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
